"'''Timeline 18: The Force War on Tython'''" would have been the eighteenth in the ''[[Galactic Timeline]]'' series of in-universe videos, providing backstory for the ''[[Star Wars: The Old Republic]]'' video game. The video would have been presented in the form of a record entry made in the [[Jedi Archives/Legends|Jedi Archives]] by [[Jedi Master/Legends|Jedi Master]] [[Gnost-Dural]].

The remaining ''Timeline'' videos were discontinued in early 2011, as the content was growing less relevant to the game.<ref name="TORQA">{{TORweb|url=blog/community-qa-march-23rd-2012|text=Community Q&A: March 23rd 2012}}</ref>

==Publisher's summary==
''Several Tythonian''[sic]'' scholars began to use their knowledge of the Force to pursue power. A conflict ensued which destroyed Tython''.

